## SAVE (OUTPUT) NODE — verified from Sample 2 (OUTPUT1)
===========================================================================
action = "save".

```json
"OUTPUT1": {
  "action": "save",
  "parameters": {
    "dataset": {
      "type": "analyticsDataset",
      "name": "Forecast_Dataset4",
      "label": "Forecasted Baseline Sales Units Dataset",
      "folderName": "CR_sampleForecastBaselineIndirectNew_V1"
    },
    "fields": [],
    "measuresToCurrencies": []
  },
  "sources": ["<last node>"]
}
```
name + label are REQUIRED. folderName sets the target app.
Missing label → run fails "Output dataset label can not be empty".

