## FILTER NODE
===========================================================================
action = "filter".
```json
"parameters": {
  "filterExpressions": [
    { "type": "TEXT", "field": "IsClosed", "operator": "EQUAL", "operands": ["false"] }
  ]
}
```
operator: "EQUAL" (verified). Booleans use type "TEXT" + string operand "false"/"true".
No "logic" key. No OR inside one filterExpressions array — use two filter nodes or a
formula flag field then filter on it.

Sample 1 also uses action = "sqlFilter" for SQL-expression filters — read it if you
need a complex filter condition.

