## VERIFIED PATTERN — Boolean fields from SFDC_LOCAL — string comparison in formula SQL
VERIFIED 2026-09-06: Boolean fields loaded from SFDC_LOCAL (e.g. IsClosed, IsWon, SDO_Sales_Stalled_Opportunity__c) are stored as strings "true"/"false" in the recipe engine. In formula nodes (expressionType:"SQL"), compare them as string literals with single quotes: IsClosed = 'false', IsWon = 'true'. DO NOT use native boolean (= true / = false) — that causes immediate progress:0 run failure. Filter nodes already use type:"TEXT" + operands:["true"] which is consistent with this. Probe recipe DS_Probe_Bool_Test confirmed this on storm-org.


