## VERIFIED PATTERN — Win/Loss closed-opp recipe pattern (FILTER → JOIN×3 → SCHEMA → FORMULA chain)
VERIFIED 2026-09-06: Filter IsClosed with type:"TEXT", operands:["true"] on LOAD node directly (before joins). Then LEFT_OUTER join Account (rightQualifier:"Acct"), User/rep (rightQualifier:"Owner"), User/manager via "Owner.ManagerId" left key (rightQualifier:"Mgr"). SCHEMA renames Acct.*/Owner.*/Mgr.*. Formulas chain: FORMULA0(Outcome) → FORMULA1(Sales_Cycle_Days using AgeInDays) → FORMULA2(Deal_Size_Band by Amount tiers). AgeInDays on a closed opp = total sales cycle days. Deal_Size_Band: Enterprise>=100000, Mid-Market>=25000, SMB>=5000, else Small. 477 rows on storm-org.


