## VERIFIED PATTERN — Account 360 roll-up pattern: Opp aggregate → LEFT_OUTER join to Account
VERIFIED 2026-09-07: Aggregate Opportunity rows by AccountId (FORMULA chain for conditional sums → AGGREGATE0 groupings:["AccountId"]), then LEFT_OUTER join Account (left) to AGGREGATE0 (right) using leftKeys:["Id"] rightKeys:["AccountId"] rightQualifier:"Opp". SCHEMA renames Opp.* fields. Then JOIN User owner/manager as normal. Formula flags pattern: one FORMULA per flag (Is_Won, Is_Lost, Is_Open, Won_Amount, Open_Amount, Weighted_Opp) chained before AGGREGATE. Win_Rate formula: case when Total_Opps > 0 then Won_Opps / Total_Opps * 100 else 0 end. Customer_Tier: >=500000 Strategic, >=100000 Key, >=1 Growth, else Other. 1103 account rows on storm-org (most have no opps → Other/No History).


