## VERIFIED PATTERN — FiscalYear/FiscalQuarter are integers — cannot group in SAQL, cannot cast to TEXT in recipe
VERIFIED 2026-09-07 on storm-org: Opportunity.FiscalYear and FiscalQuarter are INTEGER fields from SFDC_LOCAL. In CRMA datasets they land as MEASURES (numbers). Cannot group by them in SAQL (error 119: "Invalid group expression: FiscalYear. Dimension field or a non-epoch date access function expected"). Cannot convert to TEXT in recipe formula (cast(), '' || field, concat() all fail with syntax error). typeCast node with typeProperties.type:"TEXT" deploys OK but FAILS at run time (progress=0.33, after load step). WORKAROUND: Use CloseDate_Year and CloseDate_Quarter (auto-generated date dimensions from the CloseDate field — type TEXT, groupable) for fiscal period filters and chart groupings in dashboards. Keep FiscalYear/FiscalQuarter as raw numeric fields in the dataset for reference; do NOT attempt to group by them in SAQL or use them as dashboard dimensions.
